   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello,<div><br></div><div>I am trying to edit a data.frame in server.UI in accordance to user inputs once the goButton is pressed.</div><div><br></div><div>What I want: once the user presses the go button, the inputs are recorded into the data.frame and the new data.frame is updated and shown in the UI.</div><div><br></div><div>I have pasted my server.UI code below, and I am not sure where I need to make the change. </div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"margin-bottom:1em;padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238);font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">output</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">text3 </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> renderText</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">({</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n      </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,139)\">if</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">goButton </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">==</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">){</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n      </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;New Patient Information Added&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n      newpatientrow </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> data.frame</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">newptnum</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> input</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">newptsy</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">0</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n      names</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">newpatientrow</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)[</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">]&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;patientlist&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n      names</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">newpatientrow</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)[</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">2</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">]&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;patientsy&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n      names</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">newpatientrow</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)[</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">3</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">]&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;patientdx&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n      print</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">newpatientrow</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n      patientdata </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> rbind</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">patientdata</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">newpatientrow</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)}</span></code></pre></div></div>"
