    [
     3,
     "<div><br><br><br>On Wednesday, March 25, 2015 at 12:37:56 AM UTC-5, Dev Dash wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>Thank you for your help. I understand what you are trying to do and I&#39;ve edited my code as such:</div><div><br></div><div><div>shinyServer(</div><div>  function(input, output, session){</div><div>    </div><div>    patientdata &lt;- reactive({readWorksheet(db, sheet=&quot;Sheet1&quot;)})</div><div>    </div><div>    output$newptnum &lt;- renderText({input$newptnum})</div><div>    output$newptsy &lt;- renderText({input$newptsy})</div><div>    output$patientdata &lt;- renderTable({patientdata()})</div><div>    observeEvent(input$goButton,{</div><div>#       &quot;New Patient Information Added&quot;</div><div>      newpatientrow &lt;- data.frame(input$newptnum, input$newptsy, 0)</div><div>      names(newpatientrow)[1]&lt;- &quot;patientlist&quot;</div><div>      names(newpatientrow)[2]&lt;- &quot;patientsy&quot;</div><div>      names(newpatientrow)[3]&lt;- &quot;patientdx&quot;</div><div>      patientdata &lt;- rbind(patientdata, newpatientrow)</div><div>    })</div><div>  </div><div>    })</div><div><br></div><div>When pressing the go button with the values (newptnum and newptsy), I get this error:</div><div><br></div><div><div><font color=\"#ff0000\">Warning: Unhandled error in observer: attempt to replicate an object of type &#39;closure&#39;</font></div><div><font color=\"#ff0000\">observeEvent(input$goButton)</font></div></div><br>On Tuesday, March 24, 2015 at 11:40:19 PM UTC-5, Joe Cheng [RStudio] wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">You should store the data frame using a reactiveValues object, and use an observeEvent to make the goButton trigger an edit.<div><br></div><div>shinyServer(function(input, output, session) {</div><div>  v &lt;- reactiveValues(data = data.frame(...))</div><div><br></div><div>  output$table &lt;- renderTable({ v$data })</div><div><br></div><div>  observeEvent(input$goButton, {</div><div>    newpatientrow &lt;- ...</div><div>    v$data &lt;- rbind(v$data, newpatientrow)</div><div>  })</div><div>})</div><div><br></div><div>We&#39;ll have a new article on actionButton published on <a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792399580717000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3uURReEKEBgDOkExIBehn8\">shiny.rstudio.com</a> someday soon.</div></div><div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Tue, Mar 24, 2015 at 3:42 PM, Dev Dash <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">pio...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hello,<div><br></div><div>I am trying to edit a data.frame in server.UI in accordance to user inputs once the goButton is pressed.</div><div><br></div><div>What I want: once the user presses the go button, the inputs are recorded into the data.frame and the new data.frame is updated and shown in the UI.</div><div><br></div><div>I have pasted my server.UI code below, and I am not sure where I need to make the change. </div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"margin-bottom:1em;padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238);font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=